#: ../../../users/advanced.rst:4
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "進階組態"

#: ../../../users/advanced.rst:7
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/advanced.rst:9
msgid ""
"Syncthing has settings that are available but not exposed in the usual "
"folder and device configuration screens. The reason for not exposing these "
"settings more prominently varies from them simply being rarely useful, to "
"them being actively dangerous when used improperly."
msgstr ""
"Syncthing 有一些可用的設定，但不會在一般的資料夾與裝置組態畫面中顯示。這些設"
"定之所以沒有更明顯地呈現，原因不一，從僅是較少用到，到在使用不當時可能帶來實"
"際風險。"

#: ../../../users/advanced.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use care when changing advanced configuration settings and make sure that "
"you understand the resulting effects and consequences."
msgstr "變更進階組態設定時請務必謹慎，並確認您了解其帶來的影響與後果。"

#: ../../../users/advanced.rst:19
msgid "Per Folder Settings"
msgstr "個別資料夾設定"
